# Skips the four CI coverage lanes take on purpose, one row per test:
# `package test reason`. Derived from the ubuntu-latest lanes of ci.yml: no tmux or
# herdr on PATH. The runner image ships Node.js, so no row skips
# for a missing node. Environment skips appear here as the runner sees them.
# The ledger is report only: `.github/scripts/skip-ledger.sh check` prints a
# skip the lanes take that no row lists, and a row no lane takes; neither fails.
